Blog posts live here as Markdown, one file per post, matching the `blog`
schema in ../config.ts.

The collection is intentionally EMPTY right now. The first three drafts are
awaiting Cheryl's clinical review in the shared Drive folder "Articles":
https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_7lYb2OiP3x3qORovG6Wg6TxLVClE7Nb

Each Drive doc carries a "PUBLISHING METADATA" block that maps to this
collection's frontmatter. Drop an approved post back in here as a .md file and
/blog switches itself from the "Coming soon" placeholder to a real index -
see src/pages/blog/index.astro, which branches on whether any posts exist.

The pre-review versions are also in git history at commit a2efbb7 if you need
the original Markdown.
